# Maze Of Words

2D FillWord puzzle (Cocos Creator **3.8.8**, web / Yandex Games). Find one main word on a letter grid; bonus words are optional.

## Where to look

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Gameplay scripts | `assets/code/` | Controllers, level flow, input |
| Portable helpers | `assets/code/self contained/` | Storage, assets, tween utils, RNG — no game coupling |
| Scene / prefabs | `assets/node/` | Editor wiring (`main.scene`, cell prefab) |
| Word dictionaries | `assets/bundle/words_all_{locale}.txt` | Loaded at runtime via Asset Bundle |
| Product intent | `README.md` | Goals, architecture, roadmap |

Ignore / never commit: `library/`, `temp/`, `local/`, `build/`, `profiles/` (regenerated by Creator).

## Agent defaults

- Prefer extending the **pipeline + events** pattern over new global singletons.
- Keep `@ccclass` names stable; scene/prefab references use script UUID from `.meta`.
- Do not invent class/method inventories in docs — describe flows and ownership instead.
- Match existing style: optional chaining for pipeline hooks, `==` for nullish checks, minimal comments.
